flowchart LR
    Client[Public Client] --> Public[public_app\n/chat /app]
    Admin[Admin / VPN / Proxy] --> AdminApp[admin_app\nagents workflows memory observability]
    Public --> Gateway[Common HTTP Guard\nrequest id • size cap • security headers]
    AdminApp --> Gateway
    Gateway --> Auth[Identity & Authorization\nadmin key • user key • agent scopes]
    Auth --> Limits[Rate Limiter\nsliding window • bounded memory]
    Limits --> Router[Task / Model Router]
    Router --> Exec[Executor Layer\ndefault • model_router • ollama • cognitive]
    Exec --> Sandbox[Capability & Sandbox Boundary]
    Exec --> Memory[Memory Ports\nin-memory • PostgreSQL/pgvector]
    Exec --> Events[Event Bus\nin-process • Redis]
    Events --> Observability[Audit / Observability\nrequest_id • metrics • event log]
    Memory --> Observability
    AdminApp --> Settings[Allowlisted Settings Writer\nmasked secrets • restart required]
    Secrets[External Secret Provider\nenv • Vault • AWS] --> Settings

